Morning gRare 💛 

The Web3 space is full of different experiments, and I find it valuable to look at what each project is actually building.

@rarelistio focuses on the creator economy, giving people opportunities to discover emerging projects, publish original content, and get recognition for their contributions.

@fomopoly_rh explores virtual real estate through an onchain city where land ownership connects with stock generation and the $DEAL economy.

@agentdojo takes AI into gaming, allowing players to customise fighters with distinct traits and compete in turn-based battles.

Creator participation, digital ownership, and AI-powered entertainment are three different areas, each with its own challenges and possibilities.

Understanding the technology and ideas behind these projects makes following their progress much more interesting.

Happy Thursday! ☀️

@fomopoly_rh is all about virtual land, stocks and $DEAL, while @agentdojo focuses on AI agents that learn and evolve through battles.

Two different concepts, both worth watching. 

